
---v6/PRESEAL.md---
# CORE70 v6 narrow controller qualification

Frozen e013/da4e candidate unchanged; no Faraday arithmetic/HEAD overlay.
V5 original entry, captures and 351213-byte metadata/262144 guard failure stay
literal. V6 removes only the redundant full inherited-seal consumption and
versions owned root paths. The inherited seal remains exactly
ea3c82e4192729f4cbd2172e9548d5e21da3d4e3d8ccbfbfa7ad591a47736301,
351213 bytes, prior accepted v4 DATA (98dcc03e); it is not needed by these
controller assertions. No cap increase or removed actual dependency admission.

All six source and four copied inventory roles remain exact, regular, bounded,
hash-bound and resolved from an explicit canonical repository root. The three
original v4 dependencies retain literal expected hashes. Old owner dependencies
retain their original hashes. Only fresh START.json changes the deadline and
its inventory hash. Node22.22.2 exact executable is streamed/authenticated.

Finite graph: preparation PURE Node; then generated PURE controller from the
isolated control cwd; then exactly two harmless fixture children if preceding
assertions pass. Two PURE processes maximum, two harmless children maximum.
Original25 PURE controls plus five root-resolution controls and18 owner
records are expected, with source-only/synthetic/actual classifications kept
separate. Product, parser, engine, Shell, Worker, build/install/native imports
and execution are forbidden. Generated fixture syntax only: two modules.

Connected file collectors before Node admission, original600000ms phase
deadline through publication, 28 known invocation-local OS starts maximum,
peak3,40MiB capture,160MiB working. Ordinary captured/retired tooling failures
may be versioned within the finite roles; safety/integrity/capture/unknown
retirement/cap failures stop dependents without retry. No fifth framework,
full305 census, repeated35 syntax checks or package decode.

All210 authored product cells remain UNRUN. H03 depth64 guard dominance and
H04 ticket exhaustion remain SOURCE-only. Actual private ArrayOwner.close
rejection remains UNOBSERVED, distinct from synthetic observer-forwarding
checks. This qualification requests independent preexec review, not actual GO.

